TITLE 1D transport with exchange; query CaX2 fraction at cell 8, shift 4

SOLUTION 0  Initial solution
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 1-10  Initial in cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 11  Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -time_step 1
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivities 0
    -punch_cells 8

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false

END
